    "notes": [
      "VARIANT OF models/seedvr2_2560x1536 (untiled decoder) -- this config instead models the VAE",
      "decoder TILED as a real 2x2 spatial grid (K=4 tiles), per explicit follow-up request",
      "('测试一下如果decoder分成4个tile时2K的roofline'). VAE encoder and DiT sections are IDENTICAL",
      "(byte-for-byte) to models/seedvr2_2560x1536/ops_mapping.json -- only the vae_decoder section",
      "differs (real per-tile shapes + x4 call multiplier, same methodology as the 1920x1088 config's",
      "own real K=4 2x2-tile derivation).",
      "Per-tile shape derivation (same halo-scaling method validated against the REAL 1920x1088 log's",
      "non-constant carry_in Parameter layouts): tile core = HALF of the full tier's H and W (2x2 grid);",
      "halo = base_halo(4,2 at the latent tier) x tier_scale, where tier_scale is 1/2/4/8 for the",
      "latent/tier1/tier2/tier3(full) tiers respectively -- this halo-growth pattern is a property of",
      "the network's receptive field / number of upsample stages between the tile boundary and a given",
      "conv, which is a RESOLUTION-INDEPENDENT architectural fact (validated at 1920x1088: latent tile",
      "72x122 = half(68,120)+halo(4,2); tier1 144x244 = half(136,240)+halo(8,4); tier2 288x488 =",
      "half(272,480)+halo(16,8); tier3 576x976 = half(544,960)+halo(32,16) -- all confirmed directly",
      "against real carry_in Parameter shapes in SeedVR2/ir/seedvr2_verbose_1080P.log).",
      "Applying the SAME formula to the 2560x1536 tiers (latent=192x320, tier1=384x640, tier2=768x1280,",
      "tier3/full=1536x2560): latent tile = half(96,160)+halo(4,2) = 100x162; tier1 tile =",
      "half(192,320)+halo(8,4) = 200x324; tier2 tile = half(384,640)+halo(16,8) = 400x648; tier3 tile =",
      "half(768,1280)+halo(32,16) = 800x1296.",
      "Call counts: the untiled config's decoder calls values ARE the correct 'per-tile' (1 tile's worth",
      "of) segment counts (calls are purely a function of video length/temporal segmentation, NOT spatial",
      "resolution or tiling -- confirmed by the untiled 2560x1536 config's calls values exactly matching",
      "the 1920x1088 tiled config's calls/4, since both describe the SAME 121-frame video's temporal",
      "segmentation regardless of spatial resolution or tile count). So tiled calls here = untiled 2560x1536",
      "calls x4 (one spatial tile multiplier), matching the 1920x1088 config's own untiled-calls-x4",
      "convention exactly.",
      "This tiled variant needs its OWN remote re-measurement ONLY for the vae_decoder section's 22",
      "specs (conv/groupnorm/fc/attention) -- the vae_encoder (19 specs) and dit (15 specs) sections are",
      "UNCHANGED from models/seedvr2_2560x1536, so their already-measured logs/metrics are reused as-is",
      "(same log tags, same shapes, same calls -- no re-run needed)."
    ]
  },
